  "rules": [
    "Only buy in Stage 2: the daily close is above its 50-, 100-, 150- and 200-day averages (10, 20, 30 and 40 weeks), and the 50-day average is above the 100- and 150-day ones.",
    "Buy when, in Stage 2, the daily close breaks above the highest high of the previous 20 days.",
    "Sell on a daily close below the 100-day (20-week) average, or below the lowest low of the previous 20 days.",
    "Hold one position per coin at a time."
  ],
  "notExpressed": [
    "Reading stages on the weekly chart: the daily 50/100/150/200-day averages stand in for the 10/20/30/40-week ones",
    "Judging the base (tight, constructive, a shakeout and higher lows) and its volume",
    "Cutting overall exposure when market breadth weakens",
    "The tactical Stage 4 mean-reversion long",
    "Sizing each trade by its stop distance, and trimming into vertical moves",
    "Short trades in Stage 4 (the test is spot, long only)"
  ],
